JavaScriptCore: ScriptExecutable.cpp includes CompilationResult.h.

ScriptExecutable.cpp names JSC::CompilationResult::CompilationSuccessful but
only gets a forward declaration (bytecode/CodeBlock.h) unless an earlier file
of its unified-source bundle happened to include CompilationResult.h. The
bundle's composition depends on the port's source list, and with WebCore in the
build it no longer does (the `jsc` shells of W2 compiled). Include what is used.

--- a/Source/JavaScriptCore/runtime/ScriptExecutable.cpp
+++ b/Source/JavaScriptCore/runtime/ScriptExecutable.cpp
@@ -26,6 +26,7 @@
 #include "config.h"
 
 #include "CodeBlock.h"
+#include "CompilationResult.h"
 #include "Debugger.h"
 #include "EvalCodeBlock.h"
 #include "FunctionCodeBlock.h"
